                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمْهَدَتْ بِوَلَدِهَا</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>She</i> (a woman) <i>brought forth,
or cast forth, her child with a single impulse.</i>
(IAar, in L, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خفد</span>.) ― 
